WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.196
Today is a special day for our family.

2
00:00:11.197 --> 00:00:16.603
It is Grandma's birthday.

3
00:00:16.604 --> 00:00:21.427
We are going to have a birthday party!

4
00:00:21.428 --> 00:00:23.394
Don't tell Grandma!

5
00:00:23.395 --> 00:00:27.137
The party is a surprise!

6
00:00:27.138 --> 00:00:32.489
Everybody has a job to do.

7
00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:38.241
My sister keeps Grandma busy outside.

8
00:00:38.242 --> 00:00:41.089
Mom bakes a birthday cake.

9
00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:44.672
Dad decorates the room.

10
00:00:44.673 --> 00:00:48.413
I set the table.

11
00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:52.525
My younger brother peeks out the window.

12
00:00:52.526 --> 00:00:56.360
He watches for Grandma.

13
00:00:56.361 --> 00:00:58.368
"Are we ready now?

14
00:00:58.369 --> 00:01:04.656
We have the cake, the birthday card, the gifts, and the candles."

15
00:01:04.657 --> 00:01:07.830
"Yes, we are ready."

16
00:01:07.831 --> 00:01:17.135
"Now whistle to your sister."

17
00:01:17.136 --> 00:01:20.305
Then she brings Grandma inside.

18
00:01:20.306 --> 00:01:26.021
Now here comes Grandma! "Surprise!"

19
00:01:26.022 --> 00:01:29.982
"Oh my!"

20
00:01:29.983 --> 00:01:33.802
"Grandma, blow out the candles!"

21
00:01:33.803 --> 00:01:36.416
"Make a wish too!"

22
00:01:36.417 --> 00:01:41.817
"Okay, my dears!"

23
00:01:41.818 --> 00:01:46.446
We all sing "Happy Birthday" to Grandma.

24
00:01:46.447 --> 00:01:52.376
Grandma has a big, big smile!

